{"steam_appid":2181610,"steam_name":"Heretic's Fork","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2181610/719511/d332a346929228854cb33848b9c4b35db3b6c676/1751086459/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1719507518","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257034334/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1719507518","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/ss_8a2fc209ec8fd62d6b420d4345410d85b6a573a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315468","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/ss_8552e7638df5e99534a2419ce4ca23a36d5750cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315468","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/ss_9ea54f302500a1cfc8a614042262617435617bf5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315468","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/ss_d3e2aeed477ad6621f8b8de52da8a1d82710d523.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315468","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/ss_dfa043c4906e3fd4c0a5308674bac3dcdd9936bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315468"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/f57c51b6a31807ed83a85593b3f065cf.webp?t=1780315468\" width=616 height=35 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for submitting your application for the position of Hell's Manager. We are pleased to offer you the job and extend a warm welcome to our team. As you may know, we have some overpopulation issues that we believe can be resolved with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/4edee26e301d759555582d23cf19ff34.poster.avif?t=1780315468\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/4edee26e301d759555582d23cf19ff34.webm?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/4edee26e301d759555582d23cf19ff34.mp4?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role will involve not only managing the current population but also implementing innovative strategies to streamline our operations. You will be tasked with punishing sinners using our state-of-the-art computer system, HERETIC'S FORK, developed by DeusVult Inc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/7dea368f3e4c23b4776282d53b5cd954.poster.avif?t=1780315468\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/7dea368f3e4c23b4776282d53b5cd954.webm?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/7dea368f3e4c23b4776282d53b5cd954.mp4?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are confident that your skills and expertise will greatly contribute to maintaining order and efficiency in our unique environment. We look forward to having you on board and seeing the positive impact you will bring to our organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/15e84f7303cc81a978b133ebc3fe20ad.poster.avif?t=1780315468\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/15e84f7303cc81a978b133ebc3fe20ad.webm?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/15e84f7303cc81a978b133ebc3fe20ad.mp4?t=1780315468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/cb4fa0987594664acd3789d143a11a35.webp?t=1780315468\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Choose a demon to act as your subordinate who will manage all site operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Protect the rift between Hell and Earth from escape attempts by dwelling heretics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Punish sinners with monstrous towers that deal Holy, Unholy, and Hellfire damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Plan strategies and build strength using our deck-building system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Achieve great results to receive more cards for your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Work for various departments, each representing a circle of Hell, and cooperate with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Ensure that sinners do not damage our property by keeping them from passing through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Receive wages for each shift based on the number of sinners punished. Your success depends solely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Be an integral part of our fun and delightful team with a shared dark sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181610/extras/afc9d4a9160877ea91579c1a9f3523df.avif?t=1780315468\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft 64bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64bit Intel compatible Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4-compliant onboard graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["9FingerGames"],"publishers":["Ravenage Games"],"release_date":"13 Sep, 2023"}